{"sym":"VAR.OL","v":2,"about":{"summary":"Vår Energi ASA operates as an independent upstream oil and gas company on the Norwegian continental shelf in Norway. The company produces crude oil and natural gas liquids. It also engages in the production, development, and exploration assets on the Norwegian Continental Shelf (NCS). The company was formerly known as Eni Norge AS and changed its name to Vår Energi AS in December 2018. The company was incorporated in 1965 and is headquartered in Sandnes, Norway. Vår Energi ASA is a subsidiary of Eni International B.V.","lead":"Vår Energi ASA operates as an independent upstream oil and gas company on the Norwegian continental shelf in Norway. The company produces crude oil and natural gas liquids. It also engages in the production, development, and exploration assets on the Norwegian Continental Shelf (NCS).","web":"https://varenergi.no","emp":1433,"city":"Sandnes","country":"Norway"},"officers":[{"n":"Mr. Nicholas John Robert Walker B.Sc.","t":"Chief Executive Officer","age":63,"yb":1962,"pay":23019000,"fy":2025},{"n":"Mr. Carlo Santopadre","t":"Chief Financial Officer","age":44,"yb":1981,"pay":7323900,"fy":2025},{"n":"Mr. Torger Rod","t":"Chief Operating Officer","age":51,"yb":1974,"pay":18899000,"fy":2025},{"n":"Mr. Sverre Bjelland","t":"Executive VP of Legal, Compliance & Public Affairs","age":50,"yb":1975,"pay":7700000,"fy":2025},{"n":"Ms. Tone Rognstad","t":"Executive Vice President of People, Communication, IT & Digital","age":58,"yb":1967,"pay":5732400,"fy":2025},{"n":"Ms. Ellen Waldeland Hoddell","t":"Executive Vice President of Sustainability & Safety","age":45,"yb":1980,"pay":4830300,"fy":2025},{"n":"Ida Marie Fjellheim","t":"Vice President of Investor Relations","fy":2025},{"n":"Mr. Ove Mikal Helle","t":"Senior Vice President of Internal Audit","pay":3203400,"fy":2025},{"n":"Ms. Annethe Gjerde","t":"Vice President of Contracts & Procurement","pay":2916700,"fy":2025},{"n":"Ms. Charlotte V. Saunders","t":"Vice Presi